            <h4 class="font-serif text-white mb-2" style="font-size: 1.15rem;">Classic Skimmer Type</h4>
            <p class="small mb-3" style="color: #CBD5E1 !important; line-height: 1.5;">Direct skimmer suction with zero balance tank needed for compact plots.</p>
